    "published": "2018-12-21T04:37:05.000Z",
    "title": "明日だよ！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13210036.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20190405104608/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13210036.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "MwW4bv6Q3p.jpg",
            "media": "2784e6147d0c.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h6Q4IjuWwaX4JMEMC1MoWKUttbxFwU3N2Y0h-RHxmY1B8XH5-YUp8SHNuKxwneUZeXVMlQm90MjhheEl-PFAucVR2bQ5yQlJ1cS9wBCw0MkomAykuMlImEHkzN0oiAmspPVIgTyo4Yg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日はタワーレコード渋谷さん、ラジオ、ネットサイン会と遅くまでお付き合いありがとうございました(*´ー｀*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天在涩谷Tower Records、广播节目和线上签售会，谢谢大家一直陪我待到那么晚(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday, thank you for staying with me late for Tower Records Shibuya, the radio, and the online signing event(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "感想やゲット報告をツイッターでみてにこにこしとります。 身近に鹿乃知ってる人がいなくて寂しい…感想語り合いたい！って人は #鹿乃 #鹿友 タグをよかったら利用してみてね！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在Twitter上看到大家的感想和“入手啦”的报告，我正乐呵呵的呢。觉得“身边没有认识鹿乃的人，好寂寞……好想找人聊聊感想！”的朋友，不妨用用 #鹿乃 #鹿友 这两个标签哦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I've been smiling at your impressions and \"got it!\" reports on Twitter. If you're lonely because you don't know anyone around you who knows Kano... and you want to talk about your impressions, please feel free to use the #鹿乃 and #鹿友 tags!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さてさて明日は、はじめてのミニアコライブ！！緊張する〜〜〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么那么，明天就是第一次的迷你原声Live了！！好紧张〜〜〜"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now then, tomorrow is my first mini acoustic live!! I'm nervous~~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーー"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京・Space emo 池袋"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "东京·Space emo 池袋"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tokyo, Space emo Ikebukuro"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "14:00 / 17:00"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "イベント当日 会場 にて2018年12月19日（水）発売 ニューアルバム『rye』（初回限定盤 / 通常盤 のいずれか）をご購入頂いたお客様に、先着で入場整理券をお渡しいたします。\nCDの販売開始時間 11:00～"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "活动当天，在会场购买2018年12月19日（周三）发售的新专辑《rye》（初回限定盘/通常盘，任一版本均可）的顾客，将按先到先得的顺序发放入场整理券。\nCD的开售时间为 11:00～"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On the day of the event, at the venue, we will hand out admission numbered tickets, first come first served, to customers who purchase the new album \"rye\" (either the limited first edition or the regular edition), released Wednesday, December 19, 2018.\nCD sales start at 11:00~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さらに詳しくは公式HPをチェックしてね！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "更多详情，请去官网确认哦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For more details, check the official website!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
