          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "待ってるよ〜〜寒いから風邪ひかないようにね！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "等你们哦〜〜天冷了，别感冒了呀！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'll be waiting for you~~ It's cold, so don't catch a cold!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
